[05/03 12:29:35     23s] @@file 2: set_db design_process_node 180
[05/03 12:29:35     23s] ##  Process: 180           (User Set)               
[05/03 12:29:35     23s] ##     Node: (not set)                           
[05/03 12:29:35     23s] 
